                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For a game in early access, it's really good: graphics is amazing and it runs smoothly on my barely-vr-ready PC. First few enemy waves are easy (maybe a bit too easy), but after that it starts to get hectic. \nPros:\n- awesome graphics\n- great music\n- arena + smacking monsters + shooting fireballs + ...\n\nCons:\n- more sound effects could be added, you hear the same slice sound when you hit the enemy\n- maybe too easy on start (first minute or so)",
